      "doc": "What a fallible call returns: \u0060KE_OK\u0060, or the code of the failure. The detail of a failure goes to the failing library\u0027s log, never into the code. A caller treats a code it does not know as \u0060KE_RESULT_GENERAL\u0060. Ignoring the result of a call is a compiler warning where the compiler supports it.",
